{"path":"io/basic_ios/rdbuf","title":"std::basic_ios<CharT,Traits>::rdbuf","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_ios&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>rdbuf","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/basic_ios/rdbuf","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Manages the associated stream buffer.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_streambuf\"><span class=\"kw1683\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_streambuf</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT, Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> rdbuf<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_streambuf\"><span class=\"kw1683\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_streambuf</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT, Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> rdbuf<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_streambuf\"><span class=\"kw1683\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_streambuf</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT, Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> sb <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Manages the associated stream buffer.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Returns the associated stream buffer. If there is no associated stream buffer, returns a null pointer.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Sets the associated stream buffer to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">sb</span></code>. The error state is cleared by calling <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ios/clear\">clear()</a></span>. Returns the associated stream buffer before the operation. If there is no associated stream buffer, returns a null pointer.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> sb\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> Stream buffer to associate to.\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The associated stream buffer, or a null pointer if there was no associated stream buffer.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>May throw implementation-defined exceptions. \n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;sstream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostringstream\"><span class=\"kw1753\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ostringstream</span></span></a> local<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> cout_buff <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a>.<span class=\"me1\">rdbuf</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// save pointer to std::cout buffer</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a>.<span class=\"me1\">rdbuf</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>local.<span class=\"me1\">rdbuf</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// substitute internal std::cout buffer with</span>\n                                    <span class=\"co1\">// buffer of 'local' object</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"co1\">// now std::cout work with 'local' buffer</span>\n    <span class=\"co1\">// you don't see this message</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"some message\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"co1\">// go back to old buffer</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a>.<span class=\"me1\">rdbuf</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>cout_buff<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"co1\">// you will see this message</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"back to default buffer<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"co1\">// print 'local' content</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"local content: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> local.<span class=\"me1\">str</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>back to default buffer\nlocal content: some message</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ios/set_rdbuf\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>set_rdbuf</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  replaces the <code>rdbuf</code> without clearing its error state <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(protected member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/basic_ios","title":"std::basic_ios"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_ios<CharT,Traits>::rdbuf","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations. Manages the associated stream buffer."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"sb"},{"label":"Return value","note":"The associated stream buffer, or a null pointer if there was no associated stream buffer."},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"May throw implementation-defined exceptions."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"set_rdbuf","note":"replaces the rdbuf without clearing its error state"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":205,"codeBlockCount":2}
